cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use MeetMind in your work, please cite it using these metadata."
type: software
title: "MeetMind: open-source AI meeting notes for Windows"
abstract: >-
  MeetMind is an open-source Windows desktop app that records system audio and
  microphone, transcribes meetings with AssemblyAI, Google Cloud Speech-to-Text
  or Sarvam AI, generates meeting minutes with Google Gemini, and syncs them to
  Notion. A Chrome extension adds one-click recording to Google Meet and Zoom.
authors:
  - given-names: Aslah
    alias: aslahtp
repository-code: "https://github.com/aslahtp/meetmind"
url: "https://aslahtp.github.io/meetmind/"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - AI meeting notes
  - meeting transcription
  - meeting minutes
  - speech-to-text
  - speaker diarization
  - Google Meet
  - Zoom
  - Notion
  - Gemini
  - Electron
